WEBVTT

01:03.229 --> 01:05.982
GENIE, MAKE A WISH

01:10.403 --> 01:12.238
KI KA-YOUNG
I STILL CAN'T REACH YOU

01:12.322 --> 01:13.948
CAN YOU CALL ME? IT'S URGENT

01:14.032 --> 01:17.077
JULY 19
I'M GETTING TRANSFERS FROM YOUR ACCOUNT

01:17.160 --> 01:19.120
SEPTEMBER 15
ARE YOU TRYING TO FUCK ME OVER?

01:19.954 --> 01:21.581
NOTICE OF DISMISSAL
PLEASE RETURN YOUR ID

01:21.664 --> 01:23.666
AND YOUR LOCKER AND BUILDING KEYS

01:27.962 --> 01:29.422
Gas meter readings.

01:31.049 --> 01:32.133
Anybody home?

01:35.303 --> 01:36.429
This is so nuts.

01:36.971 --> 01:38.014
Oh, fuck.

01:38.848 --> 01:41.184
Where the hell
did all that money come from?

01:41.267 --> 01:43.019
What is it doing here?

02:02.956 --> 02:05.208
I can breathe now. I'm not winded at all!

03:25.163 --> 03:26.915
STOP TAKING THE SLEEPING PILLS

03:26.998 --> 03:29.959
JUST TAKE 1 VITAMIN
AND GET LOTS OF SUNSHINE

03:36.925 --> 03:39.719
Try to cook all your meals,
even if you're feeling lazy.

03:40.345 --> 03:44.432
The pipes will freeze in cold weather,
so wrap lots of old clothes around them.

03:45.058 --> 03:46.351
My darling Ka-young,

03:46.434 --> 03:48.937
you're so beautiful today
as you always are.

03:49.771 --> 03:51.940
My joyous baby, be well.

04:02.075 --> 04:04.661
I know you're going through a lot
right now, but help me, please.

04:10.124 --> 04:13.002
There's a bag full of cash in my house.
I don't know how it got there,

04:13.086 --> 04:15.421
but I recognized the bag
from Dr. Choi's Instagram.

04:15.505 --> 04:16.422
I saw you carrying it.

04:17.632 --> 04:18.925
Oh. Oh?

04:20.969 --> 04:22.470
I know it belongs to you.

04:24.013 --> 04:25.139
Did I, by any chance…

04:27.100 --> 04:28.184
steal it from you?

04:30.103 --> 04:33.356
It's just that I seriously can't remember.

04:34.899 --> 04:37.026
It does seem like a thing I would've done.

04:37.110 --> 04:39.404
I envied you. I really wanted you to fail.

04:43.366 --> 04:44.993
If I did do something that bad…

04:47.036 --> 04:48.246
I'm very sorry.

04:51.332 --> 04:52.875
All that cash is yours now.

04:54.377 --> 04:56.713
You were willing to sell something for it.

04:58.089 --> 05:01.884
It was very generous,
though it didn't matter in the end.

05:03.428 --> 05:04.887
So stop worrying and use it.

05:05.471 --> 05:08.933
Uh, hang on. I mean, it's been hell
these last few days.

05:09.517 --> 05:10.852
I was so scared I'd be found out,

05:10.935 --> 05:13.187
but it felt like such a waste
to turn it all in.

05:13.771 --> 05:15.773
Despite it all, I just couldn't use it.

05:16.774 --> 05:19.736
So please, please take it all back.

05:21.446 --> 05:25.283
Any chance you could get my job
back at the bank too?

05:26.075 --> 05:27.744
Honestly, all I want…

05:30.580 --> 05:32.165
is for things to go back to normal.

05:34.208 --> 05:35.501
He was completely right.

05:39.172 --> 05:41.007
I corrupted you in the end.

06:14.540 --> 06:15.917
Grandma really said all that?

06:17.293 --> 06:18.294
Mmm-hmm.

06:20.838 --> 06:22.757
She was happy,
getting to be your grandmother.

06:23.424 --> 06:25.218
She told me to make sure you knew.

06:25.802 --> 06:27.553
I should have told you at the wake.

06:30.264 --> 06:31.391
I'm sorry.

06:32.517 --> 06:33.476
For how I was…

06:35.269 --> 06:36.270
on that day.

06:41.067 --> 06:43.069
We're still friends, yes?

06:43.152 --> 06:43.986
Yeah.

06:49.325 --> 06:51.744
-You feel you've achieved everything?
-Of course.

06:52.954 --> 06:54.247
I achieved it all.

06:55.081 --> 06:57.583
First college, then becoming a dentist.

06:59.127 --> 07:00.128
Why do you ask?

07:01.087 --> 07:03.131
Grandma was happy with me as a child.

07:04.632 --> 07:06.008
You achieved everything.

07:08.761 --> 07:09.720
So then…

07:10.763 --> 07:12.056
I'll achieve everything too.

07:15.643 --> 07:16.894
Meaning what?

07:21.899 --> 07:23.317
Tell me what you're going to do.

08:34.347 --> 08:35.723
Ka-young! Ka-young!

08:37.975 --> 08:41.062
Ka-young! No, no! Ka-young, don't go!

08:42.855 --> 08:45.691
Don't leave me alone, Ka-young!

08:48.528 --> 08:51.531
Ka-young! I can't…

09:59.181 --> 10:02.268
Get over here, Iblis! Now! Show yourself!

10:05.062 --> 10:07.815
You said you were still bound to me!

10:48.773 --> 10:50.316
Come on!

10:52.068 --> 10:55.112
Where are you? Come out, Iblis!

10:56.530 --> 10:57.657
Where are you?

10:59.575 --> 11:01.369
Come out already!

11:01.452 --> 11:03.746
Why did you go? Why?

11:21.972 --> 11:23.140
Iblis.

11:24.809 --> 11:26.435
Show your face.

11:41.075 --> 11:42.743
Come out now!

12:09.520 --> 12:12.440
Where have you been?
I've been looking for you!

12:13.315 --> 12:14.775
You left me, you jackass!

12:15.776 --> 12:17.361
You should have come when I called.

12:22.450 --> 12:23.409
You're a genie.

12:24.702 --> 12:27.705
I still have a final wish
for you to fulfill.

12:32.293 --> 12:33.919
-I will--
-Don't, please.

12:34.503 --> 12:37.339
Make a very selfish wish. Pure ego.

12:39.467 --> 12:41.969
Ka-young, come on.

12:42.720 --> 12:46.348
I want to know the pain Grandma endured
to bring up a stone as a diamond.

12:48.017 --> 12:52.521
The fear everyone felt as they helped
raise me, all the while making fun of me.

12:53.981 --> 12:56.442
I want to know Min-ji's desire
to understand me.

12:58.235 --> 13:01.155
The depth of the words you scribbled
over the lamp floor.

13:04.700 --> 13:06.202
I wish to feel it all.

13:08.704 --> 13:09.622
All emotions.

13:10.831 --> 13:11.832
Until tomorrow.

13:13.542 --> 13:17.421
Give me humanity.
I want to experience it all fully.

13:19.048 --> 13:22.301
Then when tomorrow is over,
I will return to a negative one.

13:23.469 --> 13:25.179
Someone who's denounced by all.

13:26.764 --> 13:27.848
An uncomfortable stone.

13:29.475 --> 13:30.768
That's how I'll die.

13:34.104 --> 13:34.939
This…

13:37.691 --> 13:39.109
…is my final wish.

13:49.578 --> 13:50.412
You…

13:52.289 --> 13:54.500
You honestly think
I could actually kill you?

13:56.126 --> 13:56.961
So this…

13:58.671 --> 14:00.881
this is how you've determined
you will die?

14:00.965 --> 14:03.634
I know and I'm prepared.

14:04.844 --> 14:06.053
You see, I am…

14:08.013 --> 14:08.973
very selfish.

14:12.142 --> 14:14.061
So I hope you feel avenged…

14:16.730 --> 14:18.023
and gain freedom at last.

14:23.529 --> 14:25.990
Even at the very end,
you make wishes for others.

14:37.960 --> 14:40.170
At long last, I have come to realize.

14:41.714 --> 14:42.715
You were right.

14:45.926 --> 14:47.553
Your noble creation.

14:49.430 --> 14:51.891
I shall kneel before this pure soul.

15:28.260 --> 15:30.095
You will no longer remember me.

15:34.558 --> 15:35.726
Ki Ka-young.

15:38.979 --> 15:40.773
The only master I've respected.

15:47.029 --> 15:48.030
I love you.

15:56.956 --> 15:57.915
Goodbye.

16:16.642 --> 16:17.851
Your wish is fulfilled.

16:45.796 --> 16:47.631
This is the number 7.

16:47.715 --> 16:49.508
"L," you see?

16:54.722 --> 16:56.557
-An incredible feat!
-Congratulations!

16:56.640 --> 16:57.850
-Congratulations.
-Congrats.

17:02.396 --> 17:05.107
Even if you can't return
the feeling, I still love you.

17:09.278 --> 17:12.948
Oh, my dear Ka-young. You're warm.

17:13.782 --> 17:15.951
You sweet, little baby girl.

17:16.493 --> 17:18.495
You're so brave no matter what.

17:25.002 --> 17:26.045
Grandma.

17:33.510 --> 17:35.929
I'll kill you, I'll kill you!

17:43.645 --> 17:44.938
Grandma!

17:49.860 --> 17:52.821
Grandma hopes her darling Ka-young,

17:52.905 --> 17:55.282
her sweet, darling, happy granddaughter

17:55.365 --> 17:58.160
will one day burst into tears
with longing…

17:58.243 --> 17:59.286
Sixty ticks make a minute.

17:59.369 --> 18:01.288
…and burst out laughing with joy.

18:01.872 --> 18:03.749
That's what I want for you.

18:07.920 --> 18:10.756
I grew because of her love.

18:15.928 --> 18:20.974
And she died because of me!

18:25.896 --> 18:27.397
No, no, no.

18:30.526 --> 18:32.861
I was never Grandma's strength.

18:34.446 --> 18:36.824
That was her reality.

18:38.534 --> 18:42.246
I was right, I was always
Grandma's burden.

18:44.039 --> 18:47.584
This face is hopeful. A hopeful face.

18:54.299 --> 18:57.052
Grandma!

18:58.220 --> 19:01.140
No. Grandma!

19:03.142 --> 19:06.854
I was wrong. I was wrong.

19:09.690 --> 19:11.650
Please, no!

19:13.318 --> 19:14.987
Grandma!

19:32.254 --> 19:34.756
Why? Why are you here?
Why did you lose?

19:36.425 --> 19:40.095
Ki Ka-young swore her wish
would be selfish. You made a bet together.

19:40.179 --> 19:42.139
You should've taken your revenge.

19:43.557 --> 19:45.142
Tomorrow, her life will end.

19:46.643 --> 19:47.686
Tomorrow?

19:49.897 --> 19:51.440
Shaytan!

19:52.441 --> 19:53.859
Keep your promise to Him.

19:56.320 --> 19:58.822
"The day that Iblis bows his head
before a human,

19:58.906 --> 20:00.866
you shall slit your brother's throat."

20:02.326 --> 20:04.328
Please, I beg for grace.

20:04.912 --> 20:07.497
She's good. Tell Him that,
I'm begging you.

20:08.582 --> 20:10.250
As my brother, show kindness.

20:11.293 --> 20:13.253
Everything is as He intended.

20:14.171 --> 20:17.716
I shall complete the task He bestowed.

20:59.466 --> 21:01.885
I've keenly observed
all four of your lives.

21:03.053 --> 21:05.013
I shall now return to white smoke.

21:05.722 --> 21:07.182
I ask for forgiveness,

21:09.643 --> 21:11.270
for my sins and disloyalty.

21:12.396 --> 21:14.815
You have forgotten something
of great importance.

21:15.482 --> 21:19.069
I return your forgotten past.

22:08.535 --> 22:10.912
I will remember you, no matter what.

22:13.874 --> 22:14.791
My love.

22:44.237 --> 22:45.405
Iblis.

22:48.909 --> 22:50.243
I had forgotten you.

22:53.830 --> 22:54.873
You couldn't…

22:57.584 --> 22:59.211
you couldn't kill me in the end.

23:03.090 --> 23:04.841
You failed in your duty.

23:08.303 --> 23:09.346
You failed.

23:10.889 --> 23:14.601
You failed because you love me.

23:17.437 --> 23:20.190
Because of me,
your throat has been slit.

23:26.655 --> 23:29.408
I wanted you to be free of it all.

23:30.367 --> 23:32.285
I wanted you to live!

23:33.286 --> 23:35.497
That's why I did what I did.

23:37.791 --> 23:40.752
I didn't want…

23:48.051 --> 23:49.803
No.

23:50.512 --> 23:52.139
No, no, no.

23:52.973 --> 23:54.558
It can't be!

25:12.511 --> 25:14.221
It's the Consulate General

25:14.304 --> 25:15.722
of the Republic of Korea in Dubai.

25:15.805 --> 25:18.225
We regret to inform you of the death
of Miss Ki Ka-young.

25:37.035 --> 25:38.703
A psychopath really…

25:40.038 --> 25:41.373
cried while dying?

25:43.041 --> 25:46.336
Sorrow may be fatal,
caused by a broken heart.

25:47.045 --> 25:49.339
Even so, a psychopath…

25:49.422 --> 25:51.341
should have made it through.

25:53.718 --> 25:56.012
Oh.

25:56.096 --> 25:56.972
I know.

25:57.847 --> 26:00.809
Let's make sure the funeral
is all arranged before Dr. Choi gets back.

26:00.892 --> 26:04.062
We've been attending
so many funerals lately.

26:14.406 --> 26:16.866
The repatriation process
for the body is complete.

26:17.784 --> 26:21.329
These are the only belongings
we were able to recover from the deceased.

26:35.844 --> 26:37.262
THURSDAY, OCTOBER 31, 2024

26:37.345 --> 26:39.055
KI KA-YOUNG
CREMATION UNDERWAY

26:50.609 --> 26:52.861
Thursday, October 31st.

26:55.488 --> 26:58.116
We shall now
send the deceased off in peace.

27:09.294 --> 27:11.546
It's too hot, get out of there!

27:14.966 --> 27:18.345
Get out. Get out!

27:21.431 --> 27:23.725
Oh, Ka-young!

27:23.808 --> 27:25.769
I'm sorry, Ka-young!

27:27.187 --> 27:29.898
It's too hot in there. Please…

27:29.981 --> 27:34.819
I am of the genie,
a spirit created from a smokeless fire.

27:36.821 --> 27:42.077
We were created on Thursday,
the day after the angels were made.

27:52.253 --> 27:54.964
GOBLIN STATIONERY

27:57.217 --> 27:59.260
CLOSED TEMPORARILY
DUE TO PERSONAL REASONS

28:02.597 --> 28:05.558
CHEONGPUNG HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICE

28:22.450 --> 28:27.497
THE LATE KI KA-YOUNG

28:44.139 --> 28:46.266
Tell me your wishes.

28:47.434 --> 28:49.394
Master Min-ji.

28:50.687 --> 28:52.731
Ka-young!

29:02.532 --> 29:04.075
So what you're saying is,

29:04.159 --> 29:07.787
after a thousand-year love with a genie,
you have now become a jinniya?

29:09.956 --> 29:13.042
Where'd that guy… No, uh…

29:13.126 --> 29:15.378
that genie go off to?

29:16.629 --> 29:18.089
To eternal solitude.

29:20.425 --> 29:23.344
Hey, wait.
Are… are those flowers an offering?

29:23.428 --> 29:25.722
Wait, to get wishes,
I got to offer you something?

29:27.098 --> 29:28.141
Ah.

29:29.267 --> 29:30.769
You gave money to Lee Beu-li, no?

29:31.519 --> 29:32.645
Hang on a minute.

29:32.729 --> 29:34.606
-Are you going to make a wish now?
-Can't I?

29:36.775 --> 29:39.319
You're right. Those are the rules. Hmm.

29:46.618 --> 29:47.911
No bringing back the dead.

29:49.078 --> 29:50.288
No traveling to the future.

29:51.080 --> 29:53.416
Otherwise, anything you want,

29:54.459 --> 29:58.797
your wish is my command.

29:58.880 --> 30:01.674
Ugh! Your speech sucks.

30:05.345 --> 30:09.390
Okay. Well, as my first wish, I want you
to come have stew with me every week.

30:14.395 --> 30:17.023
Your wish is fulfilled.

30:17.106 --> 30:18.191
For my second wish,

30:18.274 --> 30:21.194
direct any poor children
who need dental care to my clinic.

30:21.778 --> 30:23.863
Prices are often too high for them,
so they never go.

30:24.405 --> 30:27.867
-And for my final wish…
-Stop. Just wait.

30:28.451 --> 30:32.789
-Don't use up all your wishes at once.
-Oh, you're right. I'll save it.

30:33.373 --> 30:36.167
-Phew.
-Just these two to start. Two wishes.

30:38.211 --> 30:39.838
Both fulfilled, Choi Min-ji.

30:40.380 --> 30:42.465
Oh. Call me "Master."

30:43.716 --> 30:45.802
KING ARCADE

30:49.764 --> 30:51.516
SMILE DENTAL CLINIC

30:51.599 --> 30:53.476
ODD TEETH AND ODD PEOPLE WELCOME

30:53.560 --> 30:54.686
Huh?

30:58.189 --> 31:00.066
Wait, isn't this an arcade?

31:00.149 --> 31:01.734
Yes, the best arcade.

31:02.569 --> 31:04.654
Shall we go fight off tooth bacteria,
you and me?

31:05.947 --> 31:08.241
By the way, I heard your grades are poor.

31:08.324 --> 31:11.578
-What?
-Solve these math problems beforehand.

31:14.080 --> 31:16.875
If you don't finish them,
then no anesthesia.

31:19.085 --> 31:22.630
You'll probably hear what
I'm saying as if I'm speaking Korean.

31:23.840 --> 31:28.136
That is because I am a jinniya
who does not speak any foreign languages.

31:29.137 --> 31:31.347
So from now on,
just listen to a lot of K-pop

31:31.431 --> 31:33.308
and binge-watch a bunch of K-dramas.

31:40.189 --> 31:43.401
There's a new jinniya in town,
and she doesn't speak Arabic.

31:43.484 --> 31:44.319
Hmm.

31:45.653 --> 31:49.824
We are back at the Cheongpungho
Cherry Blossom Festival!

31:50.408 --> 31:53.036
These are a town favorite.
Five-grain crackers! Ah.

31:54.329 --> 31:55.747
-Let's go to the next booth.
-Yeah.

31:55.830 --> 31:59.125
Over here,
we have For Daughter Strawberry!

31:59.208 --> 32:01.044
Strawberries!

32:03.713 --> 32:05.465
Here's your popcorn.
Would you like a drink?

32:07.634 --> 32:10.929
Hello, we are Cheongpungho Bank.
Come for a free consultation.

32:14.641 --> 32:15.808
Ki Ka-young.

32:16.726 --> 32:17.977
Here you are. Huh.

32:18.937 --> 32:21.648
Seriously, every time I see you here,
my heart races.

32:22.190 --> 32:24.275
You sure you won't be spotted back here?

32:25.985 --> 32:27.987
Everyone sees a different face on me.

32:28.780 --> 32:30.365
It is a shame, to be honest.

32:32.533 --> 32:33.576
I'm so pretty.

32:35.828 --> 32:39.791
Despite everything
I've learned, I still vote for science.

32:42.335 --> 32:43.378
Hey, come over here.

32:51.302 --> 32:54.055
Thought you'd be off the hook this year?
Don't be naive, my friend.

32:55.640 --> 32:58.226
Three, two, one.

33:04.565 --> 33:06.985
AS SEXY
FUCK YOU

33:13.366 --> 33:15.451
KI KA-YOUNG
YOU'RE IN MY HEART

33:15.535 --> 33:17.787
Wasn't cheap, but worth every cent.

33:40.351 --> 33:42.478
I had spent a lot of time thinking

33:42.562 --> 33:44.772
about what I would do if you died.

33:45.648 --> 33:48.693
But I was wholly unprepared for what to do

33:49.736 --> 33:50.945
if you cried.

33:51.487 --> 33:53.448
So I thought about it for a few days.

33:54.991 --> 33:55.908
What, then?

33:57.577 --> 34:01.581
You see, whoever you are,
a jinniya or Ka-young,

34:02.415 --> 34:03.416
whatever.

34:04.292 --> 34:07.003
I just want this new life
to make you happy forever.

34:10.923 --> 34:12.341
So, don't cry

34:13.509 --> 34:14.385
and don't die.

34:17.638 --> 34:20.224
I want you to reunite
with the one you miss the most.

34:22.977 --> 34:24.812
That is my third wish.

34:24.896 --> 34:27.690
Wait, no. You'll forget me.
You can't do it yet!

34:32.153 --> 34:34.739
Oh. Why am I not glowing?

34:35.448 --> 34:36.407
What's happening?

34:37.617 --> 34:40.119
Oh, does that mean this wish
has been fulfilled already?

34:40.703 --> 34:42.038
Ah, yes.

34:42.121 --> 34:43.664
Of course, I've met you again.

34:44.332 --> 34:45.374
Ah, that was scary.

34:45.875 --> 34:49.754
Here's the thing,
the moment the wishes have been--

34:49.837 --> 34:52.673
I'll come back soon. Be well.

34:54.092 --> 34:54.926
Ki Ka-young.

35:01.599 --> 35:02.725
Oh.

35:06.979 --> 35:07.939
Excuse me.

36:52.919 --> 36:53.920
Grandma?

36:59.675 --> 37:00.843
Grandma, you here?

37:06.682 --> 37:07.558
Grandma, wait!

37:18.361 --> 37:19.528
Come visit again.

37:21.197 --> 37:22.281
Come next year too.

37:24.116 --> 37:25.326
Please come every year!

37:34.252 --> 37:36.295
So, this here is a painting

37:36.379 --> 37:39.340
that belonged to my forefathers
six generations ago.

37:39.423 --> 37:40.591
The style is very unique.

37:40.675 --> 37:42.677
I wanted to get it properly authenticated

37:42.760 --> 37:44.929
and see if it's indeed
a Joseon dynasty artifact.

37:45.012 --> 37:46.681
Yes, this is technically speaking

37:46.764 --> 37:48.683
a portrait of an unknown
but beautiful woman.

37:48.766 --> 37:51.560
However, most portraits of women
from this time have an eastern flair,

37:51.644 --> 37:54.063
or as this one appears to be done
in the Egyptian style.

37:55.231 --> 37:59.402
So many things have happened,
but I'm still just the assistant manager.

38:00.903 --> 38:02.863
I want a rival company to poach me.

38:03.906 --> 38:05.116
This is my final wish.

38:05.199 --> 38:08.369
Give me a key trade secret,
something the supermarket keeps hidden.

38:09.620 --> 38:10.579
Simple.

38:19.297 --> 38:20.381
Listen closely.

38:22.508 --> 38:25.011
I'm going to tell you
an important trade secret.

38:32.268 --> 38:34.729
Display the Jin Ramen
at the front of the store.

38:50.828 --> 38:52.705
You must have felt lonely as well.

38:53.414 --> 38:55.666
People would always forget you.

38:57.585 --> 38:59.337
Leaving you all on your own.

39:02.423 --> 39:03.674
It's raining.

39:03.758 --> 39:05.843
A rain full of petals.

39:07.595 --> 39:11.015
This here is the time for it.

40:20.084 --> 40:21.377
Hey, lump of clay.

40:24.171 --> 40:25.214
I sure missed you.

40:27.007 --> 40:28.342
How are you even here?

40:29.301 --> 40:30.344
Min-ji's wish.

40:31.303 --> 40:32.930
You can't bring back the dead, though.

40:34.098 --> 40:36.767
I have no idea. Let's just enjoy it.

40:39.603 --> 40:41.647
Seriously, just go!

40:42.231 --> 40:44.733
Why'd you come all the way here
just to mess with the system?

40:44.817 --> 40:46.110
You brat!

40:47.069 --> 40:48.946
How dare you raise your voice! Huh?

40:49.697 --> 40:51.782
I have literally nothing
to be afraid of now,

40:51.866 --> 40:53.784
not even if you said
I'd die a second time.

40:53.868 --> 40:55.703
And I'm not scared of hell either.

40:55.786 --> 40:58.247
You have nothing to threaten me with.

40:58.330 --> 41:00.875
All I want is for you and I

41:00.958 --> 41:03.377
to have a word with the big man upstairs.

41:03.461 --> 41:06.464
Human lunatic!
You can't march up to Him like that!

41:07.298 --> 41:09.842
Come on! You're guaranteed
a spot in heaven already!

41:09.925 --> 41:11.844
Why are you here instead of going there?

41:11.927 --> 41:13.137
Heaven?

41:14.805 --> 41:16.891
-I don't give a damn about that.
-Huh?

41:17.433 --> 41:19.810
What use is heaven to me
now that Ka-young is a Satan?

41:19.894 --> 41:22.897
And you. You revealed to me
the day I would die.

41:23.522 --> 41:26.192
Is that even allowed?
You were awfully cryptic about it too.

41:26.275 --> 41:28.444
I barely managed to figure it out.

41:29.028 --> 41:30.738
I only got it because I'm so clever.

41:31.405 --> 41:34.408
So, you owe me, wouldn't you agree?

41:34.950 --> 41:36.243
You said you're an angel.

41:36.327 --> 41:39.747
After all the havoc you've caused,
it's the least you could do! Right?

41:44.001 --> 41:45.461
What do you even want?

41:47.713 --> 41:49.632
Yes, sir. I know she's still at it.

41:51.175 --> 41:53.052
What's that? Oh, well, but--

41:53.928 --> 41:55.930
Even so!

41:57.348 --> 41:59.808
Despite that--

42:01.310 --> 42:02.144
Yes, I understand.

42:04.730 --> 42:05.689
So, then.

42:06.482 --> 42:08.817
To Goryeo? With all my might?

42:24.500 --> 42:26.418
So once again you're clueless, right?

42:27.169 --> 42:28.963
You're being like this
the second you see me?

42:29.755 --> 42:33.676
Whatever. I won the title
of "Most Famous Genie" anyway.

42:33.759 --> 42:35.719
I never agreed to that. No way!

42:36.971 --> 42:40.224
-I'd rather die than let you have that.
-Why not? Let me have it!

42:42.518 --> 42:43.811
Look what else I can do.

42:51.443 --> 42:52.278
Oh.

42:54.196 --> 42:55.531
Ha!

43:00.494 --> 43:03.789
You're just the same as always.

43:06.458 --> 43:07.585
Creepy as hell.

43:09.503 --> 43:10.462
And really cute.

43:23.684 --> 43:26.937
Oh, can you hurry up?
We need to get seats right at the front!

43:28.731 --> 43:30.691
Why are we even here this early?

43:31.400 --> 43:34.445
Harvesting cabbage is a great gig.
It pays well and they feed you too.

43:34.528 --> 43:37.698
These jobs are hard to get
in the current unemployment crisis.

43:37.781 --> 43:39.366
See, there's already three people here.

43:39.450 --> 43:41.160
-Mr. Kim, you're here. Hi.
-Oh. Hi.

43:42.453 --> 43:45.080
Hurry up and sit down.
I hope they take at least four.

43:45.164 --> 43:46.832
-Have you eaten?
-Oh, of course.

43:47.499 --> 43:49.543
My goodness, aren't you
a strapping young man.

43:49.627 --> 43:52.838
Pretty hard time out there, huh?
You're even talking to yourself.

43:55.299 --> 43:56.675
Wait, am I only able to see you?

43:58.010 --> 44:00.971
That's… that's really,
really difficult to do.

44:01.055 --> 44:03.557
It took me over 10,000 years.

44:03.641 --> 44:06.226
The typical, slow to learn type.

44:07.895 --> 44:08.812
Shit.

44:09.521 --> 44:10.773
Can't have that.

44:10.856 --> 44:13.150
Change your clothes.
They could choose up to five people.

44:13.233 --> 44:14.151
Why should I?

44:14.234 --> 44:16.362
So you can work. Come on.

44:16.445 --> 44:18.072
Don't you know? Genies don't have money.

44:18.656 --> 44:20.949
Says who? You think I don't?

44:21.825 --> 44:24.078
What? You have money?

44:31.460 --> 44:34.004
Told ya.

44:34.880 --> 44:36.465
Whoa! Wow!

44:37.883 --> 44:39.343
Whoo!

44:39.885 --> 44:42.554
-Please give me some!
-My money!

44:44.181 --> 44:46.266
As if you even deserve any of it.

44:47.267 --> 44:49.853
You go play video games
and stuff like that.

44:49.937 --> 44:51.855
The only thing you can use this on
is a haircut.

44:52.564 --> 44:53.732
It's for a good cause.

44:54.566 --> 44:55.984
I want to try making Sade again.

44:56.527 --> 44:59.113
This time, I'm using masks and pomades.

44:59.697 --> 45:02.908
I want it to be extra healthy.
That way he might have a nicer face.

45:04.034 --> 45:05.452
Ah, yes, that's right.

45:05.536 --> 45:07.162
I can get on board with the long hair.

45:08.205 --> 45:10.040
Why did you make him
from hair you'd cried on?

45:10.124 --> 45:14.128
Well, the first Sade died protecting me
in our great war.

45:15.170 --> 45:18.799
After the war ended, I included a drop
of my sadness and made a new one.

45:19.383 --> 45:21.218
The beast you saw was the second one.

45:21.301 --> 45:24.221
Mmm. I should have known.
He was pretty damp.

45:25.180 --> 45:28.517
I intend to make him dry this time around.

45:31.061 --> 45:32.896
Mmm. Duty calls.

45:45.826 --> 45:47.953
Mmm… Hmm.

45:49.455 --> 45:50.414
Ooh.

45:52.166 --> 45:54.376
Oh.

45:56.712 --> 45:58.964
Who are you?

45:59.047 --> 46:00.257
What's with your hair?

46:01.133 --> 46:04.094
My hair is on its own journey.
Sorry if I startled you.

46:04.178 --> 46:05.471
I have a message for you.

46:06.972 --> 46:11.018
I am a Genie, a spirit of the lamp.
I shall grant you three wishes.

46:11.101 --> 46:14.188
Okay. I'm talking to a genie.

46:15.063 --> 46:16.982
Nice try, buddy. I know this is a con.

46:17.065 --> 46:20.527
That's a common reaction.
This manual will clarify.

46:21.069 --> 46:23.655
First page wishes I can do,
last page wishes I can't.

46:27.117 --> 46:28.535
WISH-MAKER'S MANUAL

46:28.619 --> 46:30.370
Now, think carefully on the details.

46:30.454 --> 46:31.705
Immortality?

46:31.789 --> 46:33.582
Instant regret.
Watched three vampire movies.

46:33.665 --> 46:34.958
Change the past?

46:35.042 --> 46:37.169
A butterfly effect
that could destroy everything.

46:38.754 --> 46:39.880
Just pass on that one.

46:40.422 --> 46:43.759
Now, if you have the means,
would you buy me one of these coffees,

46:43.842 --> 46:44.968
as I cannot?

46:49.056 --> 46:50.516
So you say you're a genie?

46:51.058 --> 46:52.392
-You can grant wishes?
-Mm-hmm.

46:52.935 --> 46:54.978
So why are you here begging me for a wish?

46:57.606 --> 47:01.276
Well, didn't you ever have faith
in a higher power?

47:01.360 --> 47:04.404
A pure soul, manifesting divinity,
all that?

47:04.488 --> 47:06.573
Ah, you believe in ancestral deities?

47:09.409 --> 47:11.620
Ah, now I'm in a good mood.

47:12.871 --> 47:16.333
We have a higher power too.
Diamond levels have high status.

47:17.417 --> 47:19.795
"Germanium jade mats"?
Right, what kind of carpet is that?

47:19.878 --> 47:23.382
To put it simply,
it generates heat all on its own.

47:23.465 --> 47:25.759
Just like magic.

47:25.843 --> 47:27.010
Oh.

47:27.094 --> 47:28.887
You start off with ten.
And then after that,

47:28.971 --> 47:31.390
once they've been sold,
you get another one completely free.

47:31.974 --> 47:32.850
-Free?
-Mmm.

47:32.933 --> 47:34.810
-Uh… I can get one for free?
-Yes.

47:34.893 --> 47:38.647
And that is why we never ask our clients
for money upfront, unlike others.

47:38.730 --> 47:40.858
This deal is once in a lifetime.

47:42.317 --> 47:43.902
-So no money upfront ever?
-Mmm-hmm.

47:44.486 --> 47:46.780
I'll stop working in the cabbage fields,
in that case.

47:47.823 --> 47:50.742
Oh. No, I can pick cabbage
and sell carpets too.

47:53.078 --> 47:56.248
Okay, Mr. Kim, Mr. Choi, Mr. Park.
Sang-hyeok when he's grown.

47:57.040 --> 47:58.375
Ejllael…

47:58.458 --> 48:01.587
-Hmm, he won't buy one from me.
-Excuse me? If you could sign here.

48:01.670 --> 48:03.422
Min-ji!

48:04.047 --> 48:05.674
Has forgotten who I am.

48:06.216 --> 48:07.134
Oh Pan-geum!

48:07.676 --> 48:09.052
Has… Oh.

48:09.887 --> 48:11.388
Never mind.

48:11.972 --> 48:14.474
This is such a great product,
but I can't sell it.

48:15.934 --> 48:17.603
No matter what, I'm always short.

48:17.686 --> 48:19.271
Irem is smoke again, Sade is gone.

48:20.439 --> 48:21.940
I miss Grandma Pan-geum.

48:24.735 --> 48:25.819
Are you well?

48:27.279 --> 48:28.864
You're keeping an eye on us, right?

48:30.157 --> 48:31.366
We're doing well, I swear.

48:31.450 --> 48:34.036
Uh, I don't think
you're the right fit.

48:35.704 --> 48:37.497
Let's just forget
the whole thing, all right?

48:40.375 --> 48:43.295
Where are you going? You haven't wished
for anything yet. Wait!

48:44.963 --> 48:47.299
Make your wish.
No bringing back the dead.

48:48.133 --> 48:49.468
No traveling to the future.

48:50.052 --> 48:51.845
Otherwise, anything you want,

48:51.929 --> 48:55.724
your wish is my command.

48:57.893 --> 49:00.979
You're headed straight for the road!
Why do you always run that way?

49:13.367 --> 49:14.201
Hey.

49:15.410 --> 49:18.246
Did you use a whole bottle of conditioner?

49:18.830 --> 49:22.751
Well, I had to do it to recreate Sade.

49:23.835 --> 49:26.213
I'm going to kill you!

49:28.340 --> 49:29.925
-Come here!
-You come.

49:30.008 --> 49:31.635
Get over here!

49:31.718 --> 49:33.303
-Come here!
-I don't wanna!

49:33.387 --> 49:35.514
-Get back here!
-I said, I don't wanna!

49:35.597 --> 49:37.391
Don't steal my things!

49:37.474 --> 49:39.142
Don't be a child!

49:39.977 --> 49:42.813
-Get over here! I said, get over here!
-No.

49:43.438 --> 49:45.440
Oh. Oh, look it's back!

49:48.110 --> 49:50.112
Look. Look what else is here.

49:53.115 --> 49:55.409
You used up an entire bottle
of conditioner

49:55.492 --> 49:56.910
and he looks exactly the same?

49:56.994 --> 50:00.163
I used to feel ashamed.
I thought his face was because of my hair.

50:00.872 --> 50:02.332
I gotta say, I'm kind of relieved.

50:03.959 --> 50:06.294
Hi, Master. Miss Ki.

50:12.968 --> 50:14.469
I missed you!

50:20.267 --> 50:22.394
Not again! Ow, let me go!

50:22.477 --> 50:24.604
Let go!

50:24.688 --> 50:27.232
Hey! You want to get stabbed again?

50:27.315 --> 50:31.737
-I'm busy trying to grow back my wings!
-You're evil, Ejllael!

50:31.820 --> 50:34.322
Bring Irem back!

50:34.906 --> 50:37.659
Aah! Let go! Come on, please!

50:38.243 --> 50:39.619
Ugh, get off!

50:53.633 --> 50:54.760
It's been a minute, brother.

50:57.387 --> 50:58.889
I suppose you got your head back on?

50:58.972 --> 51:00.974
Oh, yes, thank you for the well wishes.

51:01.058 --> 51:02.893
And thanks for throwing the lamp
this way too.

51:02.976 --> 51:04.728
But why haven't you gone home yet?

51:04.811 --> 51:06.813
You are aware of how many buildings I own.

51:06.897 --> 51:09.316
Land is meant to be
a long-term investment.

51:09.399 --> 51:12.778
Oh, and know what else?
Ki Ka-young still hasn't bowed either.

51:12.861 --> 51:15.864
Where did you hear that? She bows
before her grandma's grave every day.

51:16.448 --> 51:17.824
Dead humans don't count!

51:18.533 --> 51:21.787
I'm still traumatized
by Pan-geum's bellowing.

51:22.454 --> 51:23.872
Threats?

51:23.955 --> 51:26.291
I'm so sick of her kind.
They're so unpredictable.

51:27.042 --> 51:28.585
She refused heaven and reincarnation.

51:28.668 --> 51:31.254
For days on end, she shouted for Him
to bring you back!

51:32.089 --> 51:33.715
Ugh, I feel like such a loser now.

51:37.177 --> 51:38.011
Wow.

51:40.263 --> 51:42.224
So I was brought back because of her.

51:42.307 --> 51:46.478
The point is, Oh Pan-geum asked
that I relay this, to you and Ki Ka-young.

51:47.562 --> 51:48.396
I'm all ears.

51:49.523 --> 51:52.025
Sade!

51:52.818 --> 51:55.654
Jinniya! Iblis!

51:56.404 --> 51:57.989
Mr. Village Chief!

51:58.865 --> 52:01.618
GERMANIUM JADE MAT

52:07.541 --> 52:09.876
What's that?

52:12.921 --> 52:15.423
Oh, uh, it's from, uh,

52:15.507 --> 52:17.342
ages ago.

52:17.884 --> 52:20.387
If I sell ten, I get another one
entirely for free.

52:21.096 --> 52:23.348
It's like magic.
It generates heat on its own.

52:23.431 --> 52:26.434
Well, you know,
I give one smack free after ten.

52:26.518 --> 52:28.228
-Get over here!
-Okay, hear me out!

52:28.311 --> 52:31.356
Now that Sade and Irem are back,
I've got nine customers to sell to!

52:31.439 --> 52:34.359
-I just need one more person. Hey!
-You should have a coffee.

52:35.485 --> 52:38.613
Oh, by the way, I heard Mr. Kim
from the cabbage patch died yesterday.

52:39.990 --> 52:42.993
-What?
-Where… where did you get those?

52:43.535 --> 52:46.037
Did you also join a pyramid scheme?

52:46.663 --> 52:49.416
-Wait, where did you--
-They're pretty, aren't they?

52:49.499 --> 52:51.209
They were buried
in the corner of the lamp.

52:55.922 --> 52:58.758
I think it's still got
Jinniya's perfume on it.

52:58.842 --> 53:00.552
Sade, you idiot!

53:02.804 --> 53:05.640
Happy early wedding.
A wedding gift for you.

53:05.724 --> 53:08.393
Pretty sure you made it clear
we can't go to the future.

53:08.476 --> 53:11.146
So you missed the part
where I beat you to a pulp!

53:11.730 --> 53:12.731
Get over here, right now!

53:13.857 --> 53:15.817
Get back here!

53:16.818 --> 53:18.695
Oh, hot. Ouch.

53:32.000 --> 53:33.335
The sword came back?

53:40.675 --> 53:43.094
Do you see that dust devil over there?

53:43.178 --> 53:46.848
In Arabic culture, that's referred to
as the "waltzing genie sandstorm."

53:46.932 --> 53:49.100
Oh, a genie? That's amazing.

53:49.184 --> 53:51.853
Like all those old stories?

53:52.729 --> 53:56.233
Wow, look at that!
So impressive! My goodness!

53:56.316 --> 53:58.401
Dr. Choi. You're doing this tour again?

53:59.861 --> 54:00.779
Yeah.

54:01.571 --> 54:03.949
I just cannot get enough of this view.

54:30.475 --> 54:31.309
Oh.

54:33.645 --> 54:37.232
We've been waltzing for decades now
and you still step on my feet?

54:38.566 --> 54:41.236
I did it on purpose, so that
we don't forget where we started.

54:42.487 --> 54:44.114
There's something I've wanted to say.

54:45.282 --> 54:46.449
-Ha--
-Don't!

54:48.368 --> 54:50.578
Let's keep them in suspense
a little longer.

54:52.289 --> 54:54.499
-Everybody watching is waiting for it.
-Mmm-hmm.

54:54.582 --> 54:56.668
Thinking we'll end with "habibti."

55:00.797 --> 55:03.091
I thought I could sense prying eyes on us.

55:05.051 --> 55:08.179
What I was going to say was
"Hi, Grandma."

55:10.640 --> 55:12.142
Mmm. Oh, I see.

55:13.643 --> 55:15.645
Grandma? My grandma?

55:16.271 --> 55:20.066
Yes. Your grandma is why
I'm even back at all.

55:21.109 --> 55:21.943
And,

55:23.611 --> 55:25.280
she wanted to relay one last thought.

55:27.782 --> 55:32.329
I SHALL NOW LEAVE YOU EACH
WITH ONE SATAN AND ONE PSYCHOPATH

55:32.412 --> 55:35.290
MAY YOU BOTH LOVE AND LONG FOR EACH OTHER

55:44.341 --> 55:46.634
Hmm?

55:47.344 --> 55:48.428
Duty calls.

55:49.721 --> 55:51.514
Give it your best, psychopath.

55:53.058 --> 55:56.478
Oh, I'll be just fine.
See you in a bit, Satan.
